<title>JAPAN: Hirano Tecseed - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hirano Tecseed - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.03		vs	    5.33</p>
<p> Operating   prft 102 million	 vs   loss 180 million</p>
<p> Current     prft 126 million	 vs   loss 144 million</p>
<p> Net	    prft 71 million	 vs   loss 146 million</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 4.61 yen	  vs     loss 9.50 yen</p>
<p> Shares		15 million	 vs	   15 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hirano Tecseed Co Ltd is a medium-sized producer of floating dryers and heat treatment machines.</p>
